0.2.11\n(March 2024).\n\n`unsafe-libyaml` is a machine translation of libyaml's C code into unsafe\nRust (c2rust). Bugs found in it will not be fixed upstream. It is used by\n`serde_yaml` (itself deprecated) and by forks such as `serde_yaml_ng`.\n\n## Alternatives\n\nConsider a YAML parser written in safe Rust, for example:\n\n- [saphyr](https://crates.io/crates/saphyr) ([serde-saphyr](https://crates.io/crates/serde-saphyr) for serde users)\n- [noyalib](https://crates.io/crates/noyalib)","date":"2024-03-25","aliases":[],"related":[],"collection":"crates","categories":[],"keywords":[],"cvss":null,"informational":"unmaintained","references":[],"source":null,"url":"https://github.com/dtolnay/unsafe-libyaml","withdrawn":null,"license":"CC0-1.0","expect-deleted":false},"affected":null,"versions":{"patched":[],"unaffected":[]}},{"kind":"unmaintained","package":{"name":"zbus_names","version":"4.3.4","source":"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index","checksum":"d8bf88b4a3ff53e883001e0e0115b297a9d53c31b9c1edd2bfdd853e3428624e","dependencies":[{"name":"serde","version":"1.0.229","source":"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"},{"name":"winnow","version":"1.0.4","source":"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"},{"name":"zvariant","version":"5.15.0","source":"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"}],"replace":null},"advisory":{"id":"RUSTSEC-2026-0371","package":"zbus_names","title":"`zbus_names` is unmaintained","description":"The `zbus_names` crate is no longer maintained as a standalone crate.\n\nIt has been merged into [`zbus`](https://crates.io/crates/zbus) starting with version `6.0.0`, as its `names` module.\n\nUsers should migrate to [`zbus`](https://crates.io/crates/zbus), with its default features disabled if they only need the D-Bus name types.","date":"2026-10-16","aliases":[],"related":[],"collection":"crates","categories":[],"keywords":[],"cvss":null,"informational":"unmaintained","references":[],"sour